  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Givargemensam fond f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d till UN-Habitats globala Vatten- och sanitetsprogram. Programmet bygger till stor del p&#xE5; de tidigare regionala programmen &quot;Water for African Cities&quot; och Water for Asian Cities&quot;. &#xD6;vriga givare &#xE4;r bl a Holland, Norge, Spanien, Canada. Programmet st&#xF6;ds &#xE4;ven via globala medel, se insats 71003549.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MultiDonor Trust Fund for support to the UN-Habitat global Water and Sanitation Program. The program is to a large extent a continuation and merging of the previous &quot;Water for African Cities&quot; and &quot;Water for Asian Cities&quot;. Other donors include Netherlands, Norway, Spain and Canada. The program is also supported from the Global appropriation, see contribution 71003549</narrative>
  </description>
